{
  "slug": "conotate",
  "name": "Conotate",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A toolkit for generating and managing structured knowledge bases of code domains — explore, document, and navigate large codebases with AI-assisted markdown knowledge files",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `explore-domain` (Use when you want to generate or update a structured knowledge base markdown file for a specific folder…), `read-knowledge` (Use when you want to load an existing knowledge generated from explore-domain skill).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install conotate@claude-community` from `Lunarisnia/conotate`.",
